It emerged from somebody else that, no, we can't just go there anytime. You only time, only time black people, only time Negro people, I'm not even sure what term we used in those days. We can only go on Wednesday afternoons. And that was stunning to the group. we used in those days, we can only go on Wednesday afternoons. And that was stunning to the group.

