You can confront some fears with righteous indignation, but others borrowed deeper into the mind, and many of them start with that old question. What do these people really think of us? You're listening to Hidden Brain, I'm Shankar Vedantam. This is Hidden Brain, I'm Shankar Vedantam. Claude Steele grew up in a time when black kids could be turned away from public pools, when an employer could openly discriminate against black teenagers and dismiss them with

