not just something particular to a group. When we come back, the many ways that stereotype threat plays out in the world today. They see all the stuff on television, and murder after murder, after murder, after murder of them, people like them, and they just have to wonder, what do these people think of us? You're listening to Hidden Brain, I'm Shankar Vedanta.

